# Build-context filter for deploy/Containerfile (ADR-0026 §3). Keeps build output, dependencies, VCS data, local
# secrets and editor state out of the context: smaller uploads and no secret can reach an image layer.
# Secret patterns need the `**/` prefix: a bare pattern matches only at the context root.
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
.git
web/dist
web/coverage
web/e2e/.results
**/TestResults
**/.env*
**/*.kubeconfig
**/kubeconfig
**/appsettings.*.local.json
.claude
.vscode
.idea
# Beyond the ADR list: stale tsc incremental state (would make `tsc -b` skip work) and the overlay deploy-dev.sh
# generates from the current oc login.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
deploy/kustomize/overlays/.dev-generated
